              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin ma Lubaŋa nyuto bot lunebi ducu doŋ odoko calo buk ma gimwono doge woko ki tuŋ botwu, ma ka gimiyo bot dano mo ma ŋeyo kwan kun giwacce ni, “Bin ikwan man,” ci en gamo ni, “Pe atwero kwanone pien gimwono doge woko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok bene ka gimiyo bot ŋat ma kwiya kwan, kun giwacce ni, “Bin ikwan man,” en gamo ni, “Pe aŋeyo kwan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
